Yes, that's right. Radio can hear everything what is on repeater or hotspot, if you have dmr/ts filters turned off etc. All this you can set in a quick menu from the radio. <br>You don't have to programm these groups in codeplug. It is the advantage of OpenGD77, is much simpler.<br>In addition, if you want to TX on some group that you will not have programmed, you can simply enter its number on the keyboard (after pressing #) and connect to it. The same with private contact with the difference that you press # x2.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5052">SP9RZF</a> — Wed Jan 29, 2025 2:48 pm</p><hr />
