		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4818&amp;p=35439#p35439"><![CDATA[
Also, if you press three time on the # key, you can have access to the whole contact list.<br>The OpenGD77 firmware is more designed to have a channel per repeater, one contact list linked to it, then you can change the current TS, type the TG/PC ID, or select any contact from the codeplug contacts.<br><br>Of course, this is not mandatory, but it makes the life much easier, in opposite of the "commercial" DMR way (on channel per contact, per TG/PC: a total nightmare...).<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Tue Jan 28, 2025 6:30 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
